*MCR506-2 MCE 4-30-97
*Ref: Motorola Thyristor Device Data, Q2/95
*50V 6A pkg:TO-126 2,3,1
.SUBCKT MCR506-2 1 2 3
*    TERMINALS:  A G K
QP  6 4 1  POUT OFF
QN  4 6 5  NOUT OFF
RF  6 4    500K
RR  1 4    333K
RGK 6 5    300
RG  2 6    45
RK  3 5    15M
DF  6 4    ZF
DR  1 4    ZR
DGK 6 5    ZGK
.MODEL ZF   D (IS=2.4F IBV=20U BV=50)
.MODEL ZR   D (IS=2.4F IBV=20U BV=50)
.MODEL ZGK  D (IS=2.4F IBV=20U BV=6)
.MODEL POUT PNP (IS=2.4P BF=1 CJE=335P TF=22.1U)
.MODEL NOUT NPN (IS=2.4P BF=100 RC=60M CJE=1.68N CJC=335P TF=1.47U)
.ENDS
